Keeps everything under replay/ out of the pipeline workspace build.

ads_messages here is a reconstruction of HATCI's message definitions, for
replaying their recorded bags offline. It must not end up in the same
workspace as the pipeline, because if HATCI's real package is ever installed
alongside it, ROS 2 Humble matches on type NAME only and the two would be
indistinguishable at runtime.

Build it deliberately, into its own overlay. See ads_messages/README.md.
